<!-- Template Description -->
Returns the maximum of two numeric values. Compares the first and second parameters and returns the larger one.

==Syntax==
{{T|Max/2|v1=|v2=}}

==Examples==
{{T|Max/2|v1=3|v2=5}} → 5<br/>
{{T|Max/2|v1=10|v2=2}} → 10<br/>
{{T|Max/2|v1=-4|v2=0}} → 0<br/>

